---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Contact | slipfallcalculator.com';
const description = 'Contact the editorial team at slipfallcalculator.com with corrections, feedback, or questions.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p>For corrections, feedback, or questions about content on slipfallcalculator.com, email us at <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a>. We read every message and aim to respond within five business days.</p>

  <h2>What we can help with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Factual corrections.</strong> If you believe a page contains an inaccurate legal standard, an outdated statute, or a calculation error, tell us the page URL and the specific issue. We take accuracy seriously and will review promptly.</li>
    <li><strong>Methodology questions.</strong> Questions about how the calculator works, what data sources the multiplier ranges are based on, or how a particular input is treated are welcome. The <a href="/methodology/">methodology page</a> covers the full model, but we&rsquo;re happy to clarify specifics.</li>
    <li><strong>Broken links or technical issues.</strong> If a page isn&rsquo;t loading correctly or a link is broken, let us know.</li>
    <li><strong>General feedback.</strong> Suggestions for additional guides, topics we haven&rsquo;t covered, or ways to improve the tool are appreciated.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we cannot help with</h2>
  <p>We are not a law firm and cannot provide legal advice or respond to requests for case-specific analysis. If you need guidance about your own slip and fall claim &mdash; whether to accept a settlement offer, how to negotiate with an adjuster, or whether you have a viable case &mdash; consult a licensed personal injury attorney in your state. Most handle premises liability cases on contingency (no upfront fees) and offer free initial consultations.</p>

  <p>We also cannot recommend specific attorneys or law firms, verify that a particular calculator result is accurate for your case, or provide expert witness services.</p>
</BaseLayout>
